      "sketched": false,
      "comments": [
        "reservationId is mapped 'user-input', but the issuing screen (My Reservation) IS connected to the My Reservation read model and displays this value - so the field does have a board source, unlike Make Reservation's inputs. Should the mapping be 'My Reservation.reservationId' to reflect that the guest selects a displayed reservation rather than typing an id? The accepted no-guest-identity decision (see the Notes lane in this column) explains why there is no session lookup, but it does not require the mapping to be user-input."
      ]
    }
